","speakerName":"キララ","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ただもう、必要がなくなっただけ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯える感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"おいおい、こんなんで本当に大丈夫なのか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯える感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"もし、万が一効かなかったら……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アカフユ","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無用な心配をするでない！　キララの策は聞いただろう。この作戦は必ずや成るぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アカフユ","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ましてここにはこの私がおるのだ！　手負いのまま戦に臨むのは慣れておる。この程度の傷ならば、賊どもを相手取るのは造作もないわッ……！　うぐっ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ハニーベリー","speakerId":"avg_449_glider_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無理しちゃだめですよ、アカフユさん！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウタゲ","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"一部はキララの囮作戦にうまく引っかかってくれたみたいね。残ったのはー……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウタゲ","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"ふむふむ、まあこんぐらいならギリどうにかなるっしょ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アカフユ","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誠にもってその通りだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アカフユ","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐らく、こうした場面も想定しての策であろうな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウタゲ","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"んじゃ、善は急げってヤツだね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウタゲ","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"みんな準備はいい？　このスイッチを押しちゃうからね……そーれポチッと！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大柄な強盗","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"なっ……なにごとだ！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶悪な強盗","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"術師のアーツだ！　おい、早く退け！　死にてぇのか！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大柄な強盗","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"一体どこからこんな大勢の術師を……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大柄な強盗","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"ガハッ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウタゲ","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"気を付けなよ～、危ないのはアーツだけじゃないんだから、ね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶悪な強盗","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"……てめぇら、いったい何をしやがった！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶悪な強盗","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"俺たちはずっとここを見張ってたんだぞ！　応援が駆け付けられるわけ――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウタゲ","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"あっれ～、知らないの？　感染者は素手でアーツを撃てるモンなんだよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウタゲ","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"人って追い込まれたら、何をしでかすか分かったもんじゃないね、そう思わない？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶悪な強盗","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウタゲ","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"やだ偶然～。この村の住人ってみーんな感染者だったんだね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウタゲ","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"あんたたちに好き勝手させるくらいなら、自爆してでも道連れにしてやる！　って思ってる人が、この中で何人いんのか当ててみる？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶悪な強盗","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"……イカレてやがる！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"絶望した強盗","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"こいつらイカレちまったんだ！　俺たちを道連れにする気だ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"絶望した強盗","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"に、逃げろっ！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"息巻く感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"おい見ろ、あいつらが本当に撤退し始めたぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯える感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"本当か！？　た、助かったぁ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯える感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"まさかこんな小さな箱にここまでの効き目があるとは……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アカフユ","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ふむ、予想を上回る効果だ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ハニーベリー","speakerId":"avg_449_glider_1","isRemote":false,"text":"た、確かに！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ハニーベリー","speakerId":"avg_449_glider_1","isRemote":false,"text":"スイッチが押された途端、周りから一斉にアーツを展開したような音が鳴り出しちゃって、さすがにびっくりしました。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アカフユ","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事前に仕込んだ投影設備を巧みに利用し、敵を翻弄するとは、キララならではの妙策と言えよう……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アカフユ","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"しかし、こうも短時間でほうぼうの手回しを済ませるとは、一体どんな手を使ったのだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯える感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"あー、その機械なら、あのピンクの髪のお嬢ちゃんが今朝ワシらに頼んで設置させたものだよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アカフユ","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"なに？　今朝とな？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アカフユ","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"その頃はまだ賊どもの存在に気付いたばかりで、襲撃が起こる前ではないか！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アカフユ","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アカフユ","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ドクター殿は一体何を教え込んだというのだ……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"キララ","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"タイムアップだね。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冴えてる強盗","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"てめぇ！　何しやがった！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冴えてる強盗","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"地面が崩れて……くそっ、俺たちをここで食い止めるつもりか！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴な強盗","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"助けてくれぇ！　埋もれちまう！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冴えてる強盗","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"おいクソガキ！　他の連中の命がどうなってもいいのか！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冴えてる強盗","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"俺たちをここで生き埋めにしようが、村の連中はとっくに──"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"キララ","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"もー、うるさいなぁ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"キララ","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"私はノーダメクリア以外、狙ってないし。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冴えてる強盗","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"は？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"キララ","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明らかに囮だとしても、無視はできないはず。完全には信じてなくとも、一部の人員を割いて追撃させるだろうと思ったんだ。それが狙いだしそれで十分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"キララ","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"私っていう戦力外のサポキャラで一定数を引き付けて足止めに成功すれば、あとは村に残った強キャラのウタゲたちで片付けてくれるだろうから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"キララ","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"それにプロジェクターの仕掛けもあるし……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"キララ","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"キララ","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ん？　待て待て、何説明モードに入ってんだ私。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"キララ","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自分の計画を自慢げに解説するのは悪役ってのがお約束じゃん。そんでだいたいそこで形勢逆転されちゃうんだよな……やめだやめ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冴えてる強盗","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"一人で何ごちゃごちゃ言ってんだてめぇ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"キララ","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"デバフかかってるヤツは黙りなよ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウタゲ","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":true,"text":"やっほーキララ～、聴こえてる～？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アカフユ","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":true,"text":"ウタゲ、無駄口を叩いてる暇はないぞ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アカフユ","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":true,"text":"キララ、よくやった！　おかげでこちらは無事に片が付きそうだ。そちらは？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ハニーベリー","speakerId":"avg_449_glider_1","isRemote":true,"text":"キララさん、ケガしてませんよね？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"キララ","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……えへへ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"キララ","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大丈夫、ケガはしてないよ。こっちも無事に終わったから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"キララ","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"オッホン。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"キララ","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"すべては私の……計画通り！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_337_utage","aliases":["ウタゲ"]}]}
